			"notes": "## Changed\n- Updated for **Minecraft 26.3** (Fabric Loader 0.19.5+ / Fabric API 0.161.0+; NeoForge `26.3.0.7-beta`+). Requires Minecraft 26.3.\n\n## Fixed\n- **Capture Crate + Hydrofarm beds:** the crate was listed in the `#capturenet:nets` tag that Hydrofarm's Husbandry and Butcher Beds use to recognise a net. A crate can't hold a bed's single-animal handoff, so sneak-clicking a stocked bed with an empty crate pulled an animal out into a slot the crate never shows — effectively losing it. The crate is no longer in that tag; beds now correctly ignore it. (Nets are unaffected.)\n- Recipe-book advancements updated to the 26.3 trigger format.\n\n## Notes\n- NeoForge for 26.3 is still in **beta**; this build targets `26.3.0.7-beta`.\n- Nets and crates carry their contents over; nothing is lost on update."
		},
